  "history": {
    "claims": [
      {
        "text": "In his early years, an unexpected surprise while refining Gu gave Twelfth Hair a completely new Gu embryo from a failed refinement. After his immortal ascension he raised this Gu to rank six. The Gu makes him rather special among the hairy man Gu Immortals of Lang Ya Sect, because he cultivates enslavement path alongside refinement path. The previous Lang Ya land spirit encouraged Twelfth Hair to keep cultivating both paths, since the enslavement path dao marks he carries can greatly help in refining enslavement path Immortal Gu.",
